159
00:07:40,784 --> 00:07:42,864
Therefore, I should be the one to sleep on the floor.

160
00:07:43,664 --> 00:07:45,414
Even if you say so...

161
00:07:45,414 --> 00:07:49,244
I can't let a girl sleep on the floor while I sleep in the futon.

162
00:07:49,244 --> 00:07:51,754
Then let's do this.

163
00:07:56,464 --> 00:07:59,004
If we do this, we can both sleep in the futon.

164
00:07:59,004 --> 00:08:01,134
Uh, that's a little...

165
00:08:01,474 --> 00:08:04,554
Don't worry, I sleep very peacefully.

166
00:08:04,554 --> 00:08:05,684
Well, it's not that...

167
00:08:06,104 --> 00:08:08,564
I definitely won't kick you.

168
00:08:08,564 --> 00:08:10,064
Right...

169
00:08:13,564 --> 00:08:18,734
Senpai, what's the reason for your argument with your father?

170
00:08:20,864 --> 00:08:23,324
Ah, if you don't want to say it, I won't force you to.

171
00:08:23,324 --> 00:08:26,994
I'm thinking of going to Tokyo University.

172
00:08:26,994 --> 00:08:27,994
Eh?

173
00:08:27,994 --> 00:08:30,664
My father is against that.

174
00:08:30,664 --> 00:08:35,214
He thinks if I go to the city, I'll never come back.

175
00:08:35,584 --> 00:08:39,804
I get dizzy if I just get a <i>whiff</i> of alcohol,

176
00:08:39,804 --> 00:08:41,554
