177
00:08:43,054 --> 00:08:46,474
But I could help out with the marketing.

178
00:08:46,474 --> 00:08:55,564
So I want to go to university and study business management and product development.

179
00:08:55,944 --> 00:09:00,004
Then I want to let more people know about our sake,

180
00:09:00,004 --> 00:09:01,944
