181
00:09:03,654 --> 00:09:08,034
Senpai, have you told your father about this?

182
00:09:08,034 --> 00:09:10,704
I've told him many times.

183
00:09:10,704 --> 00:09:14,464
The first time I told him I wanted to go to Tokyo University,

184
00:09:14,464 --> 00:09:16,794
