185
00:09:17,084 --> 00:09:21,964
The second time, both of my parents suddenly became very irritated.

186
00:09:22,504 --> 00:09:26,134
And the one after that, my father got angry again.

187
00:09:26,134 --> 00:09:29,804
The next time, a huge argument took place.

188
00:09:29,804 --> 00:09:33,394
And the time after that, a customer came in just as I was about to talk about it.

189
00:09:33,394 --> 00:09:35,434
And the next time-

190
00:09:35,434 --> 00:09:37,904
Ah, it's fine, I understand.

191
00:09:37,904 --> 00:09:40,234
In the end, you didn't get to say it.

192
00:09:41,194 --> 00:09:43,824
I get the feeling that I will never be able to say it.

193
00:09:43,824 --> 00:09:45,244
That can't be true.

194
00:09:45,864 --> 00:09:48,704
If a chance comes, you should take it.

195
