207
00:10:18,854 --> 00:10:22,614
I'd been planning to apologise to you for that for a long time.

208
00:10:22,614 --> 00:10:25,694
I was worried, since I couldn't get to say it.

209
00:10:25,694 --> 00:10:26,744
Senpai.

210
