It's time for you to wake up!

218
00:11:03,274 --> 00:11:06,484
Just because it's summer vacation doesn't mean you sleep in!

219
00:11:09,744 --> 00:11:11,704
Kazuma-kun, are you awake?

220
00:11:11,704 --> 00:11:14,224
I'm going to open the door!

221
00:11:14,914 --> 00:11:15,664
W-Wait a sec!

222
00:11:25,454 --> 00:11:27,674
