226
00:11:37,144 --> 00:11:39,104
...the hunter will...

227
00:11:39,104 --> 00:11:41,124
...be surprised?

228
00:11:41,124 --> 00:11:45,424
Even the hunter will refrain from killing
the bird that has flown to him for shelter.

229
00:11:45,424 --> 00:11:47,154
Yeah, that's it!

230
00:11:47,154 --> 00:11:53,494
Anyway, with that in mind, as the landlady of Yorozuyo Inn, I can't ignore someone in need.

231
00:11:54,914 --> 00:11:55,874
<i>However</i>,

232
00:11:55,874 --> 00:11:58,204
