233
00:11:58,204 --> 00:12:02,624
While you're staying here, I'll have you work as a waitress.

234
00:12:02,624 --> 00:12:03,834
Is that fine?

235
00:12:09,674 --> 00:12:11,944
It looks great on you.

236
00:12:12,964 --> 00:12:15,144
Er, why me too?

237
00:12:15,144 --> 00:12:18,034
Since Tsumugi and her family went for short holiday,

238
00:12:18,034 --> 00:12:21,024
I'm in need of another person right now.

239
00:12:21,904 --> 00:12:24,984
So, I'll leave things to the two of you.

240
