It's not just you that gave birth to that kid.

312
00:15:38,924 --> 00:15:40,594
So, what are you going to do?

313
00:15:40,594 --> 00:15:41,804
What do you mean, what am I gonna do?

314
00:15:41,804 --> 00:15:46,894
She's our cute daughter, and it's not like I don't know why you want to keep her by your side.

315
00:15:47,514 --> 00:15:50,524
But you've got to keep her feelings in mind.

316
00:15:52,194 --> 00:15:53,854
