317
00:15:55,274 --> 00:15:58,074
I know that...

318
00:15:58,824 --> 00:16:02,824
Yorozuyo Inn

319
00:15:58,824 --> 00:15:59,784
Eh?

320
00:15:59,784 --> 00:16:02,824
Senpai's father wants to have a battle with me?

321
00:16:02,824 --> 00:16:05,874
Well, even though he says "battle", it's just a tug-of-war contest.

322
00:16:05,874 --> 00:16:06,454
Huh?

323
00:16:06,454 --> 00:16:07,414
Tug-of-war?

324
00:16:07,414 --> 00:16:09,704
It's an old custom.

325
00:16:09,704 --> 00:16:14,174
When two villages are in dispute, they
send out their strongest representatives,

326
00:16:14,174 --> 00:16:17,794
and in front of Kotama Shrine, they
decide who wins by the tug-of-war contest.

327
00:16:17,794 --> 00:16:23,324
During my grandmother's time, there were even things like two men who were both chasing the same girl,

328
00:16:23,324 --> 00:16:26,264
and they decided who would get
her through the tug-of-war contest.

329
00:16:26,264 --> 00:16:29,814
To think that there are still people who want to settle disputes through such a method...

330
00:16:29,814 --> 00:16:31,684
But why does he want to challenge me?

331
00:16:31,684 --> 00:16:36,314
It seems that he thinks Kazuma-kun is the
disgusting insect sticking to his dear daughter.

332
00:16:36,314 --> 00:16:37,904
Disgusting insect...

333
00:16:37,904 --> 00:16:38,774
