339
00:16:51,164 --> 00:16:54,254
If Kazuma-kun is the winner, she gets to make her own choice.

340
00:16:54,584 --> 00:16:59,464
If Sakai-san is the winner, she has to go home quietly. All right?

341
00:16:59,464 --> 00:17:00,304
Yes.

342
00:17:03,384 --> 00:17:04,974
